The agent host's Copilot API calls omit VS Code's integration id (ROADMAP P0-8).

Companion to patch 0005. The agent host's own Copilot API client
(@vscode/copilot-api: models list, chat completions, utility requests) sends
Copilot-Integration-Id: code-oss unless a request suppresses it; upstream's
comment says suppressing it makes CAPI "authorize against the token's real
entitlement". Triage's users sign in with Triage's own GitHub OAuth app, so
every request suppresses it. This is the likely reason the owner's model
picker offered only "Copilot Fusion" (inferred).

